  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "榕仔跤"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>Lêng Pōe-jû</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī廟埕有一欉榕仔，伊是逐家ê好朋友。逐家lóng愛來chia，對逐家來講，chia是一个好所在。老大人tī榕仔跤開講兼拍lā涼。有ê人泡茶、行棋，有ê人拍拳頭、練氣功。熱天ê時，榕仔跤ê涼風是天然ê冷氣。涼涼ê風chiok秋凊，一時仔無注意就tī chia睏--去--ah。榕仔跤mā ē-tàng講是逐家ê眠床。Chia mā是賣涼水ê頭家做生理ê好所在。下晡時仔雄雄排一擔hoah講「枝仔冰、汽水、冬瓜茶……」。逐家lóng想beh買一杯來lim，lim了真正透心涼。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">囡仔kah意tī榕仔跤peh-koân-peh低、sì-kè chhit-thô，也ē-sái sńg bih-sio揣。Iáu ē記得細漢，我上愛坐阿公ê o͘-tó͘-bái去chhit-thô。阿公lóng ē載我去kám仔店買四秀仔，了後就來廟口榕仔跤。Tī榕仔跤，阿公伊lóng ē陪我幌韆鞦。我ē kā阿公講我beh幌khah koân，阿公就照我ê意思。有tang時仔mā ē踮邊--a看阿公kah人行棋。若感覺無聊，我就家己去sńg塗跤ê榕仔子，等到阿公thuh一盤棋。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Chit-má若來到榕仔跤，我lóng ē想起阮阿公kah囡仔時chūn ê快樂。榕仔跤有我kah阿公共同ê記憶，mā是無法度koh tńg--去ê過去，阿公chit-má已經無tī--leh。逐擺來到榕仔跤，就感覺ná親像阿公koh tī我ê身邊。細漢有你ê疼惜，我真正chiok幸福。阿公你chit-má好--無？我chiok想--你，你kám知影？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b><br /></b></span></p><p></p><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /><br /><br /><b>（作者是成大台語認證班第十期學員）</b></span><br /><p></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhERjH18ktdlIOFm29WSOcqZ4XyPUI3h2HrZ7bLcsUTa1KA4u7ANcQpwh6mLXJ5Hi1HOopxFSreVZntEBYY03dUknYjF-2jvSpp35QRJQ_btcDI_soWSX05s5cgjdoDstKl1x_8whKvz_LeDwh_CKbb2iqaBXOEd5QlKImFuCTdFsAE3aBLAgMo0DcLaw/s1421/342%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1421\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhERjH18ktdlIOFm29WSOcqZ4XyPUI3h2HrZ7bLcsUTa1KA4u7ANcQpwh6mLXJ5Hi1HOopxFSreVZntEBYY03dUknYjF-2jvSpp35QRJQ_btcDI_soWSX05s5cgjdoDstKl1x_8whKvz_LeDwh_CKbb2iqaBXOEd5QlKImFuCTdFsAE3aBLAgMo0DcLaw/w450-h640/342%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhtskP7CNg3J6PsBBeb59vSE7MYEQao4UXQpxjsKxC0yhpZqCa27Ya9XcxQ04ioFQdPJLR1lCNlRlHrGNOt3cdzTK9TfWAew7Iy-T8MJ7X5VSsnjLTFCF3o5SFlv1jLjdKIEslD6EcAI0ZDgX6w1ImAZ-dIWtoBUiNSSkJ28OddEudmvVDfy6oyatq0Ug/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1342%E6%9C%9F_039.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhtskP7CNg3J6PsBBeb59vSE7MYEQao4UXQpxjsKxC0yhpZqCa27Ya9XcxQ04ioFQdPJLR1lCNlRlHrGNOt3cdzTK9TfWAew7Iy-T8MJ7X5VSsnjLTFCF3o5SFlv1jLjdKIEslD6EcAI0ZDgX6w1ImAZ-dIWtoBUiNSSkJ28OddEudmvVDfy6oyatq0Ug/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1342%E6%9C%9F_039.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>台灣人寫真&nbsp;</b><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span>專欄，</span><span>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南